{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dinosaur horror experience. Enter the Deathground with a team of up to 4 players for squad-based terror or attempt to survive alone in a solo session. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary and Intense AI Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring powerful and reactive dinosaurs that hunt you down, influence decision-making and drive a tailored experience. Players must navigate perilous environments and evade deadly threats to complete critical missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/AI.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic gameplay driven by stealth, combat and teamwork. Players interact with a range of weapons and tools and maps contain proc-gen elements and varied objectives that create unique and engaging sessions with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Intensegameplay.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With team-based objectives, suspenseful gameplay and constant mortal danger round every corner, teamwork and cooperation are essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Squadplay.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Soloplay.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience pure fear in claustrophobic settings that put the player's survival instincts to the test. We harness the power of Unreal Engine 5 to create realistic and diverse environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Environments.gif?t=1744300396\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1200770?t=1744300396","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744300396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744300396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744300396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content which is not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual acts or drug and alcohol abuse."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST DEATHGROUND!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Steam-Store-Wishlist_600x250px_GIF.gif?t=1744300396\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add Deathground to your wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The best thing you can do to support us is wishlist the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help boost the game's visibility on Steam with just a click, it'll also ensure that you get notified as soon as we release. We appreciate your support!</p></p><br><h1>GET EARLY DEVELOPMENT UPDATES ON DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/DiscordSteam.jpg?t=1744300396\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join our Discord Server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get regular sneak peeks and behind-the-scenes of Deathground's development, chat with our community and feedback on the game. You never know, you might find your future squad mates there.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dinosaur horror experience. Enter the Deathground with a team of up to 4 players for squad-based terror or attempt to survive alone in a solo session. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary and Intense AI Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring powerful and reactive dinosaurs that hunt you down, influence decision-making and drive a tailored experience. Players must navigate perilous environments and evade deadly threats to complete critical missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/AI.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience dynamic gameplay driven by stealth, combat and teamwork. Players interact with a range of weapons and tools and maps contain proc-gen elements and varied objectives that create unique and engaging sessions with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Intensegameplay.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With team-based objectives, suspenseful gameplay and constant mortal danger round every corner, teamwork and cooperation are essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Squadplay.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Soloplay.gif?t=1744300396\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience pure fear in claustrophobic settings that put the player's survival instincts to the test. We harness the power of Unreal Engine 5 to create realistic and diverse environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/Environments.gif?t=1744300396\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>","developers":["Jaw Drop Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/header.jpg?t=1744300396","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 Jaw Drop Games 2025. All Rights Reserved. <br />\r\nDeathground and Jaw Drop Games logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of Jaw Drop Games Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117194,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie480.mp4?t=1742558739","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie_max.mp4?t=1742558739"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117194/5fb951d0254d6d0aca6fe2be5be9280b15582310/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742558739","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742558739","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117194/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742558739"}},{"highlight":true,"id":256965581,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256965581/movie480.mp4?t=1742558743","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256965581/movie_max.mp4?t=1742558743"},"name":"Gameplay Teaser Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256965581/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1742558743","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256965581/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742558743","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256965581/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742558743"}}],"